1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,858
Meet Ace Time Tracker.

2
00:00:01,858 --> 00:00:05,190
A calm, simple way to see where your time really goes.

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,933
Open the app, and your day is already waiting.

4
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:14,070
Time tracked so far, your streak, and progress toward this week's goals.

5
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,256
Ready to work?

6
00:00:16,256 --> 00:00:19,794
Tap Start session, pick what you're working on, and press play.

7
00:00:19,794 --> 00:00:21,760
When you're done, one tap saves it.

8
00:00:25,729 --> 00:00:27,275
Forgot to track something?

9
00:00:27,275 --> 00:00:28,346
Add it afterwards.

10
00:00:28,346 --> 00:00:33,043
Choose a category, set when you started and finished, and Ace adds up the time.

11
00:00:33,043 --> 00:00:34,649
Jot a quick note, and save.

12
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:41,655
Everything you log lives in your history.

13
00:00:41,655 --> 00:00:45,638
Search it, filter it, fix a mistake, or track the same thing again.

14
00:00:47,048 --> 00:00:54,658
And for the bigger picture, Reports compare any period with the one before, check your goals, and share a PDF or CSV.

15
00:00:57,408 --> 00:00:58,442
Ace Time Tracker.

16
00:00:58,442 --> 00:00:59,416
Track your work.

17
00:00:59,416 --> 00:01:01,058
Make time for what matters.
